; The OCaml estate as one dune project (README.md, dune-project). `dune build` from this
; directory builds every directory listed here into ocaml/_build, and `dune build <dir>` one of
; them.
;
;   gen/     the LCNF route: Lean's machine and checker as generated typed OCaml, and its check
;   eff/     the Eff program IR as an OCaml library (typed embedding, wire, checker)
;   engine/  the host engine under the generated machine: math, carriers, persistence,
;            queueing, query (docs/research/2026-09-08-engine-brief.md)
;   lcnf/    the runtime library every generated file links (`effect4_lcnf`)
;   tools/   the estate's own checks: `typed_lint`, rule 7 of STANDARDS.md on the typed tree
;
; Not built from here: goldens/ (data). The avatar, the daemon `effect4d`, the wasm host,
; route 1 (link/) and the spike probes are archived on `archive/ocaml5-avatar` at `14e6835`.

(dirs gen eff engine lcnf tools)
